{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_9_level_st_09-01","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"st_09-01","title":"风暴突击","storyCode":"9-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_09-01.txt","sourceHash":"11ff90f1bca779e684c8b4b1a21b64f8d37cf8f90cbe59277b88db3d21e06499","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"风笛所属风暴突击队为了追查军用源石制品失窃案，在小丘郡郊区登陆，对情报中的某个仓库进行了突击行动。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“冬眠的山驮着高高的烟囱”\n“履带拉着我的家嘎吱嘎吱地跑”\n“我在排水沟里找到了一颗橡果，紧挨着一枚生锈的铆钉”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已进入仓库。侦查组，报告情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，东南角有生命体征。距离你们七排货架，活动范围一米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人数？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有源石反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暂时没发现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，各自就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在找什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，是不是有人在唱歌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别分心。这说明目标不在警戒状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照作战计划，等我信号，你来突入。现在，继续前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五、四、三......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掩体已破坏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......怎、怎么回事？突然好大的烟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许动！待在原地，举起双手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......你们是......维多利亚士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你这样称呼我们？你不也是维多利亚人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他要逃跑。大提琴，注意拦截！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，他没有往出口去，他折回来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三角铁！目标扑向了后排货架！只要监测到源石反应，立刻发射弩弹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人，到我盾后集合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛，你在做什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我捂住了！大家快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，没有源石反应，风笛身下不是炸弹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！虚惊一场嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......目标呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，撞得有点狠。他一时半会站不起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这些箱子里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看啊，全都是土豆和胡萝卜，还有花椰菜哎！被我压坏了。好可惜，看起来都挺好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放松警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这排，这排，还有这排......都一样。队长，这仓库里全是果蔬粮食啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三角铁，注意周围有没有其他人靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"双簧管，你和风笛一起搜查仓库。有发现随时给信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴，把这位瘫倒在地的先生绑起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，先生，麻烦你回答几个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我什么都不知道，我每天都会在这里分拣土豆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是小丘郡的居民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听说过鬼魂部队么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼......什么？呵、呵呵......部队说的不就是你们这些当兵的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"把洛瑞、朱利亚和克里斯他们抓走......现在是不是、是不是也轮到我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你冷静一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好。有人看到，昨天半夜有一批源石制品被送进了这个仓库。而如今它们不在这里。你需要对此作出解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"解释？你们真想要这个，而不是直接吊死我？我、我......呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！你怎么乱吐唾沫？也太不注意卫生了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，队长，到处都是土豆。如果消息没错的话，他们的动作有够快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带走他。他一定知道些什么，只是还不愿意开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说......你们都一样！费尽心思地找我们的错处，折磨我们......你们这些维多利亚的吃人恶兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？又来？他觉得把一个维多利亚同胞叫作维多利亚人算是种辱骂吗？真是搞不明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，有人来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（准备散开。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是，队长。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"报告，队长，他们好像是自己人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"人在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（队长，我们被包围了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（从人数上来说，是。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（听声音的话，留在外面的人好像不是很多。从我手边破墙的话，我们有机会哎！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（稍安勿躁。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来这里刚刚发生了一场激烈的战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽塔·斯卡曼德罗斯，第七前线步兵营，第二风暴突击队队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，斯卡曼......斯卡曼德罗斯中尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的名字不算好记。您可以叫我号角，上尉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，号角女士。我叫凯利，路易斯·凯利。抱歉，我们这里不流行代号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯利上尉，您和您的部下想必也是为了追查这个仓库而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们也收到了情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您应当能理解事件的严重性。一批数量不少的非法源石制品，两个月前就被人从军用运输路线上窃走，最后消失在这一带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不需要我来提醒您，上尉，这么多武器，加上周边各郡近期失窃的那些，如果全部落到不法分子的手里，受到威胁的可远不止小丘郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，谢谢你说这些。我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也很感谢您的配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"希尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"把这个年轻人......这个可疑分子抓回军营。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这人是我们好不容易找到的线索！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，她的矛在妨碍我执行任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛，松手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们的任务——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们现在在小丘郡地界上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯利上尉从口袋里掏出一块手帕，擦了擦额上的汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴你想通了，中尉。你与这位年轻的瓦伊凡女士，还有其他诸位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，你们一路从伦蒂尼姆赶过来，想必路途艰辛，累得不轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们身为维多利亚军人的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，没错。接下来，如果你们还想在小丘郡活动的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须继续追查源石制品失窃案，这是来自伦蒂尼姆的命令。我想汉密尔顿上校也会理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，当然。你们可以随我一块回军营。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我们真的要把人让给他们吗？他们绝对是故意的！从我们进入郊区地块开始，他们就跟了上来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到现在我们抓到了人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“帝国驻军有责任对驻地发生的危害公共安全的事件进行响应。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们没有违反规定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉，人是你们的了。按照规定，我们也可以参与审讯——希望您还记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈哈......这确实符合规定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要......放开我！不要抓我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"救我......救救我！我什么都没干......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"希尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"这些塔拉渣滓总是这么聒噪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯利上尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_238","isRemote":false,"text":"......带走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，这人怎么这样啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（队长，我觉得......那个年轻菲林在向我们求救。他很害怕跟他们走。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（三角铁？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在，队长。我还在外面树上老位置，他们没注意到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那就好。你带着侦察小组，继续沿附近运输路线调查。有线索立刻汇报。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角铁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。队长，需要向驻军通报吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......注意保护自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
